---
const title = 'Dentalius';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Dentalius: cuidado dental con confianza." />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">Tu sonrisa, en buenas manos</p>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p>Estamos preparando un nuevo espacio para cuidar de tu salud dental.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    color: #163b3a;
    background: #f4f8f6;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
  }
  main { max-width: 40rem; }
  h1 { margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem); }
  p { line-height: 1.6; }
  .eyebrow { color: #397a70; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
</style>
